{"sections":[{"slug":"稳定同伦范畴","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"稳定同伦范畴"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“<span lang=\"zh\">稳定同伦范畴</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“稳定同伦范畴”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>#<span lang=\"zh\">稳定同伦论</span></p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">稳定同伦范畴是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/谱","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">谱</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/无穷范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">无穷范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/同伦范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">同伦范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对于稳定同伦范畴中的对象</span> $X,Y$, <span lang=\"zh\">有分次态射对象</span> $[X,Y]_\\bullet\\in\\mathsf {Ab}^{\\mathbb{Z}}$,\n$$\r\n[X,Y]_n := [X,\\Sigma^{-n}Y].\r\n$$</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">相关概念</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/稳定∞-范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">稳定无穷范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}}]}